        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                "word": "строго",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e316df5-b5a2-3b8d-8e6b-2c2032d52dbf",
                        "entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "glosses": [
                            "сурово, без поблажек"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6a61f0e-308c-44d2-a00d-cea1a8675f6c",
                                "sense_id": "2e316df5-b5a2-3b8d-8e6b-2c2032d52dbf",
                                "text": "А также прошу вас, милостивый государь, строго следить, чтобы на улицах не было по сему поводу сборищ, радостных криков и прочее."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d28adbc8-8fcf-33c8-a474-ff9f1e1a74a2",
                        "entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "glosses": [
                            "точно, без отклонений от чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3afec76-e564-4658-810f-547385f6830c",
                                "sense_id": "d28adbc8-8fcf-33c8-a474-ff9f1e1a74a2",
                                "text": "Будучи принципиальным противником строго обоснованных, хорошо разработанных планов, Мишка Саматоха перелез невысокую решётку дачного сада без всякой определённой цели."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f6f94bb-0bf7-3e10-8615-aff09bd715cf",
                        "entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(о поведении человека) высокомерно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3b296ee-b845-4ffc-9a37-697b8c0f0604",
                                "sense_id": "4f6f94bb-0bf7-3e10-8615-aff09bd715cf",
                                "text": "Зато Зинаида держала себя очень строго, почти надменно, настоящей княжной."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dd2511a6-033f-44bd-871a-99ac069efb54",
                        "source_entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "source_sense_description": "сурово",
                        "target_lang_word": "rigorously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rigorously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4a5782e-4851-3fe5-9480-342f9dc9b628",
                                        "entry_id": "15c3f4b8-b6aa-330c-b0c9-842ef55c3640",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a rigorous manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51cc1489-5ac9-420d-a415-e3bb28f1ced9",
                                                "sense_id": "d4a5782e-4851-3fe5-9480-342f9dc9b628",
                                                "text": "But some discussion of the complex relationship between “allohistory” and sf is appropriate here, as the genres overlap in certain ways. Classical allohistory— such as Trevelyan's \"What if Napoleon had won the Battle of Waterloo?\" and Churchill's \"If Lee had not won the Battle of Gettysburg\" —is a rigorously consistent thought-experiment in historical causality."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8677fe8d-73f4-4b42-a59f-88de3071fd30",
                        "source_entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "source_sense_description": "сурово",
                        "target_lang_word": "strictly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "strictly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8f779f3-042b-3c8c-8a84-f7aa27532555",
                                        "entry_id": "3b1ad299-bb7f-3ae8-9943-2b27a578df99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a strict manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c3b9127-af51-42e0-acb5-611358fcaab0",
                                                "sense_id": "c8f779f3-042b-3c8c-8a84-f7aa27532555",
                                                "text": "He adhered strictly to the diet his doctor prescribed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae2d1577-fea4-46e7-85f1-7dc8b51a24be",
                                                "sense_id": "c8f779f3-042b-3c8c-8a84-f7aa27532555",
                                                "text": "“If any pupil considers it acceptable to bring a pet into this school, let me tell you it is forbidden. Strictly forbidden!” pronounced the headmaster from the front of the class."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9bf9e95a-64b6-3780-8627-b0cd7337bff5",
                                        "entry_id": "3b1ad299-bb7f-3ae8-9943-2b27a578df99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a limited manner; only"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a601a792-dabd-47f7-995a-cad001a0a2c3",
                                                "sense_id": "9bf9e95a-64b6-3780-8627-b0cd7337bff5",
                                                "text": "This work was strictly voluntary, but any animal who absented himself from it would have his rations reduced by half."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3dd0491-17df-3ec4-90dd-43fd28e1dabc",
                                        "entry_id": "3b1ad299-bb7f-3ae8-9943-2b27a578df99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a narrow or limited sense."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6d6684a-a654-4fb4-b920-64b4cd16b35c",
                                                "sense_id": "d3dd0491-17df-3ec4-90dd-43fd28e1dabc",
                                                "text": "That term refers strictly to smaller birds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8564fea6-411e-48b2-adb1-d308c4dbea1f",
                                                "sense_id": "d3dd0491-17df-3ec4-90dd-43fd28e1dabc",
                                                "text": "Scientific naming conventions are such that technically, ammonites are ammonoidean, ammonitidan, and sometimes strictly ammonitinan cephalopods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2fad483e-cf3d-39fe-b0d4-39c68159c172",
                                        "entry_id": "3b1ad299-bb7f-3ae8-9943-2b27a578df99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a manner that applies to every member of a set or every interval of a function"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "03dd7ed4-fd7e-4e8b-b259-726056a4d7e3",
                        "source_entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
                        "source_sense_description": "сурово",
                        "target_lang_word": "severely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "severely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                        "entry_id": "2ccf1c65-1752-3d6a-851e-3223a83c00ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a severe manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5038b5c3-08fd-4fe2-9b49-e95ff0acca2f",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "After the first day they left her severely alone, their plea to their husbands, her uncompromising independence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85b7f306-3b20-4a1c-8e22-4f387247ade8",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "Meanwhile the Christian Church from these speculations has kept itself severely apart - as of course representing a unique and divine revelation little concerned or interested in such heathenisms[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1ac5591-f352-4a92-b403-2b9257fef766",
                                                "sense_id": "18755515-c890-37e4-9d69-c0bb25ddb68d",
                                                "text": "Regular freight trains between Abergavenny and Merthyr were withdrawn on November 24, 1954, because it was found both practicable and more economical to send this traffic by less severely-graded routes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "054ecbc4-26a1-4009-bf15-100b25f6e8bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "c08da231-22f6-31e2-b1d0-596e26117497",
